# The documentation set. These are the specification, not pages.
#
# `/*.md` is ROOT-LEVEL ONLY, and the leading slash is load-bearing: a bare `*.md`
# matches at every depth and would swallow docs/ as well, which is 47 real pages
# (D-008). Every .md in this repo is either the specification at the root, a memo
# in notes/, or a docs page — there is no fourth kind.
/*.md
notes/

# Scripts, and the nine fixture pages whose entire job is to fail check-claims.py.
scripts/

# The legacy SPA's client-side router and stylesheet, retired at cutover.
js/

# Raster field photography from the SPA era. The rebuild ships no raster images;
# DESIGN.md hard rule 8 — all graphics are inline SVG from the four primitives.
img/

# build/ and media/ and node_modules/ and _site/ are already excluded via .gitignore,
# which Eleventy honours. build/ is *read* by _data/coverage.js rather than rendered.
